## Code Example
```javascript
function isSat(A,B) {
  // Clause1: (!A => B)  == (A || B)
  // Clause2: (B => A)   == (!B || A)
  // Clause3: (A || B)
  return (A || B) && (!B || A) && (A || B);
}
```

